# Read by ripgrep and tools built on it (Claude Code's Grep and Glob), not by git or Godot.
# Keeps project-wide searches to our own code. Search these on purpose by naming the path,
# e.g. `rg NetworkTime addons/netfox`.

# Third-party addons and the LimboAI demo
addons/
demo/

# Godot sidecar files
*.import
*.uid

# Large generated input maps
default_action_map.tres
openxr_action_map.tres
